{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121010050752-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121072103\"/><p>市監總局作出處罰決定。</p><p>國家市場監督管理總局周五（20日）發布《行政處罰決定書》，對百度（香港）有限公司收購歡聚集團部分業務（YY直播）違法實施經營者集中案作出處罰，決定處以50萬元人民幣（約58.8萬港元）罰款。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:56:07.590818+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T17:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:16.917272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:40.189522+00:00","content_hash":"5766d5c612ed61af77fec9a005ffa819b62957ae7db49d4b08a4f49207da0127","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}